{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d8f5c1a0-7b2e-4f91-9e12-6c40a8b31e06",
    "name": "DFSM Express Order & Fulfillment API (eklabdev/dfsm)",
    "description": "End-to-end Postman Collection for stepping through the DFSM Express REST API Server (`examples/06-express-api-server`).\n\n### Changing the Order ID (`{{orderId}}`)\nYou can change the active order ID in **any** of three ways:\n1. **Collection Variables tab**: Edit `orderId` (default `order-101`) — every `GET` and `POST /transitions` request automatically uses `{{orderId}}`.\n2. **Request Body of `01a. Create Order (Custom orderId)`**: Change `\"transactionId\"` in the JSON body; its Post-response script automatically updates `{{orderId}}` to match the created `transactionId`.\n3. **One-click Auto-Generator (`01b. Create Order — Auto-New orderId`)**: Its Pre-request script generates a fresh `order-<timestamp>` and stores it in `{{orderId}}` so you can re-run the entire workflow repeatedly without manual edits.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "order-101",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerEmail",
      "value": "buyer@eklab.dev",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Happy Path — Step-by-Step Transitions (1-by-1)",
      "description": "Walks a single `{{orderId}}` from `created` -> `inventory_reserved` -> parallel `fulfilling` (`packaging` + `shipping`) -> automatic `onDone` -> `delivered` (`COMPLETED`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01a. Create Order (Uses / Updates {{orderId}})",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Created order transaction (201)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.transactionId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', data.transactionId);",
                  "    console.log('Active {{orderId}} set to:', data.transactionId, '| currentState:', data.currentState, '| status:', data.status, '| availableEvents:', data.availableEvents);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"transactionId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customerEmail\": \"{{customerEmail}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "Starts a new DFSM transaction using `{{orderId}}` (edit `orderId` in Collection Variables or type any custom `transactionId` directly in the body — the test script syncs `{{orderId}}` automatically)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01b. Create Order (Auto-Generate Fresh {{orderId}})",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const freshId = 'order-' + Date.now();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', freshId);",
                  "console.log('Generated fresh {{orderId}}:', freshId);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Created fresh order transaction (201)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.transactionId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', data.transactionId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"transactionId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customerEmail\": \"{{customerEmail}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "Automatically generates a brand-new `order-<timestamp>` into `{{orderId}}` before sending, so all subsequent requests target the new order."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02. Get Current Order FSM Status (+ YAML)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Fetches the current persisted FSM state, `status`, `availableEvents`, `context`, `compensationStack`, and `yaml` for `{{orderId}}`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03. Step 1 — SUBMIT_ORDER (created -> inventory_reserved)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Moved to inventory_reserved', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.currentState).to.eql('inventory_reserved');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Step 1 -> currentState:', data.currentState, '| status:', data.status, '| availableEvents:', data.availableEvents);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"SUBMIT_ORDER\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"MECH-KEY-01\",\n        \"quantity\": 2,\n        \"unitPriceCents\": 8500\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04. Step 2 — AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT (enters parallel fulfilling)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Entered parallel fulfilling regions', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.currentState).to.have.property('fulfilling');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Step 2 -> currentState:', data.currentState, '| status:', data.status, '| availableEvents:', data.availableEvents);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"paymentMethod\": \"visa_4242\",\n    \"simulateFailure\": false\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "05. Step 3 — PACK_COMPLETE (packaging region -> packed)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Packaging region is packed while shipping continues', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.currentState.fulfilling.packaging).to.eql('packed');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Step 3 -> currentState:', data.currentState, '| status:', data.status, '| availableEvents:', data.availableEvents);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"PACK_COMPLETE\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"boxWeightKg\": 1.8\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "06. Step 4 — BOOK_CARRIER (completes parallel onDone -> delivered)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Parallel onDone fired -> delivered (COMPLETED)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.currentState).to.eql('delivered');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('COMPLETED');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Step 4 -> currentState:', data.currentState, '| status:', data.status, '| availableEvents:', data.availableEvents);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"BOOK_CARRIER\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"carrier\": \"FedEx\",\n    \"trackingNumber\": \"FDX-778899\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Saga Compensation Rollback & Error Recovery",
      "description": "Demonstrates `@Retry(3)` overriding YAML `retry: 2`, LIFO Saga compensation (`releaseInventory`), landing in custom `error` (`COMPENSATED`), and recovering via `RESET_ORDER`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01. Create Saga Failure Test Order (Auto-Sets {{orderId}})",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', 'order-saga-' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.transactionId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', data.transactionId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"transactionId\": \"{{orderId}}\",\n  \"customerEmail\": \"ops@eklab.dev\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02. SUBMIT_ORDER (Reserves Stock onto Saga Stack)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"SUBMIT_ORDER\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"sku\": \"GPU-90\",\n        \"quantity\": 1,\n        \"unitPriceCents\": 99900\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03. AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT (Simulate Failure -> 3 Retries -> LIFO Rollback -> error)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Compensated in LIFO order and moved to error state', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.currentState).to.eql('error');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('COMPENSATED');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.context.inventoryReserved).to.eql(false);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"AUTHORIZE_PAYMENT\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"paymentMethod\": \"declined_card\",\n    \"simulateFailure\": true\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04. RESET_ORDER (Recover from Custom Overridden error -> created)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Recovered back to created (IDLE)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(data.currentState).to.eql('created');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.status).to.eql('IDLE');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"RESET_ORDER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transitions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders", "{{orderId}}", "transitions"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
